": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Future Plans"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about:<br> <br><ul><li>events happening now or</li> <li>planned events in the near future</li></ul></br>  When you talk about events in the near future, you use time markers and prepositions of time like: <br>  <br> <ul><li>in _____ minutes/hours/days</li> <li>this morning/afternoon/evening</li> <li>tonight</li> <li>tomorrow</li> <li>on Tuesday (a future day or date)</li></ul></br>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Vanessa's studying in the library. (now)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "She's studying at Helen's house this evening. (future)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Her exam is happening on Tuesday. (future)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Aunt Nelly is leaving. (now)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Aunt Nelly is leaving tomorrow morning at 7.30. (future)"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a bit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short period of time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to the market in a bit."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about intentions. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "takeout"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "food you buy at a restaurant to eat at home"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to buy takeout."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "takeout menu"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a list of all the kinds of food that are available to buy as takeout"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm looking for the Indian restaurant's takeout menu."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "once"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "from the time when something happens"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to call for takeout once I find the number."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to decide"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a choice about something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am going to decide on what to get."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to try out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to test something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should try out that new place."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le07ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le07ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the table below about your plans for next week."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 4-5 sentences about your future plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to their sentences."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Monday</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Tuesday</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Wednesday</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Thursday</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Friday</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I organize my weekly plans in a table."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express time in complete statements about future plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read aloud to my partner about my future plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to my partner's future plans."}]}], "type": "sena"}